{title: Ye Zameen Gaa Rahi Hai}
{artist: Amit Kumar R D Burman}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Yeh zameen [A]ga rahi [E]hai aasman [A]ga raha hai
[D]Saath mere yeh sara, [E]jahan ga raha hai
[A]Shaukh kaliyo [D]ke ghunghat [E]sarkane lage hai
[A]Mast phulo [D]ke dil bhee [E]dhadakane lage hai
[E]Yeh baharo [A]kaa dilkash [E]sama ga [A]raha hai
[D]Saath mere yeh sara, [E]jahan ga raha hai
[A]Jhumkar parbato [D]pe ghata [E]chha rahee hai
[A]Pyaar ki [D]umar shayad karib [E]aa rahee hai
[E]Mera dil [A]pyaar ki [E]yeh dastaan [A]ga raha hai
[D]Saath mere ye sara, [E]jahan ga raha hai
[A]Bhul kar [D]raah koyee hasin [E]aa na jaye
[A]Iss jagah [D]koyee paradanashi [E]aa na jaye
[E]Iss jagah [A]aaj ek naujawan [E]ga raha hai
[D]Saath mere yeh sara, [E]jahan ga raha hai
